# @hub-lanes

# ── ROUTE SHADOW REPORT (P4, 2026-09-25) ─────────────────────────────────────
# Daily at 06:15Z: what the plan-driven route rules WOULD have done over the
# last 24h of builds — how many would have left the live execute model, to
# which role, per project and per rule — from the route_shadow rows every build
# writes (bin/lib/route-rules.sh). Read-only; one fleet-topic message; an
# unreadable worker is n/a, never "0 builds". docs/ROUTE-RULES.md.
# Kill: flags/lane-off-route-shadow-report, or bin/harness-ctl.sh off route-shadow-report.
15 6 * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/route-shadow-report.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
